<p>The backbone of this legal framework is the GST e-Way Bill. For every consignment moving on highways, a digital e-Way Bill is generated, linking the goods with the vehicle. This prevents illegal stops and ensures tax compliance. Alongside this, the carrier issues an IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">This document serves as the contract of carriage, detailing the origin, destination, and nature of goods.</p>
