<p>Beyond paperwork, financial risk mitigation is paramount. Reputable operators provide comprehensive 100% declared-value IRDAI marine transit insurance. This coverage is specifically tailored for land transit and covers accidental collisions, overturning, or unforeseen delays that result in damage or loss.</p>
